# Anchored to the repository root on purpose. An unanchored `data/` matches a
# directory of that name at ANY depth, which silently swallowed the whole of
# src/arc/data/ -- the package was absent from every commit, so a fresh clone could
# not import arc.train.episodic at all. Same class of bug as the `--exclude data`
# in scripts/sync.sh (docs/HANDOFF.md section 6, landmine 11). Keep the slashes.
/data/
/results/
/logs/

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
*.egg-info/
